msgctxt "228"
msgid "I can tell Natsume is a lot more fired up to be here now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "Glad she finally had a change of heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"Yes, and it's all thanks to you. With her on our side,\r\n"
"I feel as though our club has a fighting chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "And please take this as a token of my thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "You got <Color:8>300,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>30.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, you taught us all something valuable about\r\n"
"raising a hostess from the ground up. Your exploits will\r\n"
"surely go down in club history."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Oh, I don't know about that."
msgstr "Oh. Non ne sono così sicuro."

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Well, I guess this is goodbye. Perhaps you'll come and see us in your spare "
"time? Anyway, there's still much to be done, so... Good luck, Kiryu-san. And"
" take care of yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "You got 10,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"Once again, we're short on a number one hostess, but at\r\n"
"least our finances are in the green. The girls have been\r\n"
"getting along well, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "That's always good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Indeed. As a way of saying thanks, I'd like you to have this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>100.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, would you be willing to coach another hostess for\r\n"
"us? I'm sure you'd do a fine job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"It doesn't have to be now. But, if you enjoy the thrill of\r\n"
"ruling the nightlife... the joy of growing a tiny sapling\r\n"
"into a great big tree of hostessing... We'll be waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"Though we lost our number one hostess, we managed to drum up\r\n"
"some excellent business. I think we'll be able to manage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "That's good."
msgstr "Bene."

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"The girls aren't getting along too badly either, so I think\r\n"
"they've learned something by watching you work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "And please take this as a token of thanks for your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>100.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"Oh, right! Kiryu-san, would you... be willing to coach\r\n"
"another hostess?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "What? Again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid ""
"It doesn't have to be right now. But if you enjoy the\r\n"
"satisfaction of singling out a rising star and guiding her\r\n"
"to glory... We'll be awaiting your return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "Hey, what's wrong? You look like a vein's about to pop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid ""
"Oh, well, I uh... I probably shouldn't be bothering a random\r\n"
"stranger with this, but business hasn't been so good lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid "You mean at this cabaret club?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid ""
"That's right. I'm the manager here, and... Ahh, it's a long\r\n"
"story..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "Hey, would you mind if I asked you for some advice?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "Sure, why not?"
msgstr "Certo, perché no?"

msgctxt "840"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "Grazie!"

msgctxt "852"
msgid "I'd hate to make you stand in the street, so let's talk inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "Sorry, but I'm probably not the best person to ask."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid "I see... That's unfortunate."
msgstr "Capisco... Che peccato."

msgctxt "900"
msgid "Oh, are you willing to hear me out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "Sure, why not?"
msgstr "Certo, perché no?"

msgctxt "924"
msgid "Ask someone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid "Listen"
msgstr "Ascolta."

msgctxt "948"
msgid "Decline"
msgstr "Rifiuta"

msgctxt "8456"
msgid "Manager"
msgstr ""

